        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiwö asistanka korka akong nyo le mïsïk ompö koru werkoy wölo mi Elisya akïlenchï, “ECHOTYON, kirapas pontenyan! Ainkïtönyi lö kisoghöy nyinte ECHOTYON kïtenö osis. Kengwïn ye chi nyo kipösönö nyinte ropïyen kïcheng werköchan odeny, atökïlïkwï sekeykachi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïtep Elisya kokonay lö, “Imökenyi aghan ne? Mwowante lö itïngetenyi ne ompö kongu?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuyokyï kokonay lö, “Puryö kïgh nyonikïny kïpoto pat lal nyo mïnïng nyo mi mwaghpa orolwö.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenchï Elisya, “Wïyö somö pörörisköku laloy cho lyöghöy cho teno cho kenyorï. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atolapay ilït nko werköku kö ori aikar kukat, atolapay imïlchï mwaghoni lalokö chinö lyöghöy akwotini könyïghityö, imolchï kamas.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlït nyu kokonay konyi nko werkachi akïkar kukat, akïcheng lalanay mïnïng mi mwaghpa orolwö, akïmïlchï mwada lalochay, kïmi werkachi kukenu lalokö. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Otini kïnyïghityö lalochay, kïlenchï werïnyi ipunö lale anka. Kuyokyï werïnyi lö, “Pö nyoni söröm.” Melö kitökuyinï nyu mwaghay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïmïla kokonay wölo mi werkoyon Elisya, kïmwochï Elisya lö, “Altena mwaghoni pö orolwö atolapay ighaktegha pösöntineku löwïr, ngötunyi nyu ropïyen walaka cho inömonyi moneku!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Elisya nko korka nyo le sïkön nyo ngwïno Syunem",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiwö asistanka Elisya kutang Syunem, wölo kimöngöy korka nyo le sïkön. Kïkurchï kokonay Elisya omisyö. Kïlenyona kïwö Elisya kwomisyeghö konyi kïnomnyö otini kiweröy nyinte aranoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenchï kokonay pontenyi asistanka, “Konkïtwan nyoman lö chi pö Tororöt chichay weru yete kïnomnyö. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaykay keteka kö nyo mïnïng paraku konyo aketö pöröy nko mesa nko ngachar nko kitömöwon nyo ato ngwïn nyinte kïrutowech kïmi wölo töpo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kungwïn asistanka Elisya ngat wölini le Syunem akïwö kutang konyi Kumuny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïmwochï Elisya mötworintenyi Keasi kïwö kïkurï kokonay. Nyini kitï, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kïlenchï Elisya Keasi, “Mwochinö kokonï lö sörö nyoman ompö takatengu. Nyo karam kïmwowecha ye kïgh nyo kimukecha keghchine nyinte. Ato kömököy nyinte Omwochinan ngölyon pöytoghin anta wowïn pö askarin, kïmwowï.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuyokyï kokonay lö, “Ewo, otïngetan kïgh anka tïkwïl nyo komökan ompö kwenu pikachu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenchï Elisya Keasi, “Kïne nyu nyo oghchinan nyinte?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuyokyï Keasi lö, “Melö tïng nyinte worö, akikïyosit pontenyi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenchï Elisya, “Mwochinö nyinte kungwïn yi.” Kungwïn kokonay akughyongö kukat ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.18.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Tow 18:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " atolapay kïlenchï Elisya, “Irerïyenyi monïng nyo le worö ato teno nyete könyinïna.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuyokyï kokonay lö, “Ewo, echotyontenyu chi pö Tororöt! Melïsante.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wölo kïsïkisyö kokonay akïyï werïnyi ato tenö nyaye kömwochï Elisya nyinte.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Otini kiyetï monïngay, kïwö ato le tökwoghö asistanka wölo kimi kwanta kïkösöy pagh nko kösi walaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenchï paponyi, “Kaparanïn möt! Kaparanïn möt!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenchï kwanta chito ighisyenyi anka, “Sïtö montö wölo mi kame.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïsït chichay monïngay wölo mi kame, nyini kitïta kutö kame kïpesyenyi akïtöpö ntökughyö asis, kïma monïngay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïsït kame akutö pöröyu Elisya akïkar kukat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atolapay kïwö akïkur pontenyi akïlenchï, “Yonunö mötworin kungwïn yi lawel nko sïkïryö. Omökan owetöy wölo mi werkoyon Elisya atamïlan lawel.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïtep pontenyi lö, “Ompö ne temökenyi wete asisete, akwanyï melö asispa Sapato* anta Ichon pö Relïn pö Arawa?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuyokyï korkenyi lö, “Mökïghnye!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atolapay kerat sïkïryenyi atökïweghö. Kïlenchï kokonay mötworintenyi, “Ikat sïkïrye lawel ntökïtenö omwowunyi kïwö mut.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïwö nyu kutang kutïng pö Karmel wölo Elisya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyini kisïwa Elisya nyinte kungwïnöy kïtökïlow, kïlenchï mötworintenyi Keasi, “Anyinö kokonay ngwïno Syunem! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wïyö taroka nyinte lawel aitep nyinte lö mi pöghisyö nyinte nko pontenyi nko montö.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenchï kokonay Keasi, “Mi chane pöghisyö.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wölo otini kitïta wölo mi Elisya, kupïtyï tawunyi akïnam kelyo Elisya. Kïmach Keasi kïyumtö, wölo kïlenchï Elisya, “Pïstenö, mesïwïyenyinye so lö tïng nyinte nyarïl nyo wow? Wölo kawïngenanïn ECHOTYON, tomönye kimwowanïn kïgh.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlo kokonay, “Ayo echotyontenyu, kyatepinyi so lö kono monïng nyo le worö? Olentan kyolan, ‘Melïsanïn.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïwaghaka Elisya kuros Keasi akïlenchï, “Chenga lïkïnyan aiwö lawel, metöp lö oghyongöy otokwesöy chi nyo ketuyeghö ompö or anta töp chi lö otokwesinyi meyokyï ngölyon. Wïyö nyi pat ntet kö aikanagh lïkïnyan paraku montö.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenchï kokonay Elisya, “Kïle ato söpöy ECHOTYON nko nyi tïkwïl, mopïstoninyinye kwamanïn Tororöt!” Kïwö nyu Elisya nko nyinte. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuntöghoghchï Keasi chane, kïwö akukanagh lïkïyay pö Elisya paraku monïngay, wölo melö mi kïgh nyo kigha. Ki puryö macheypa söpon nyonikïny. Kïmïla wölo mi Elisya akïlenchï, “Mangetnye monïngay.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyini kitïta Elisya, kïwö onkït kïlït köyay kutomtö monïngay kima rïwöy pöröy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïkar kukat akïsagh ECHOTYON. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.17.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1Pöy 17:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atolapay kïrï paraku monïngay akukanagh kutinyi kuti monïngay akura konyichi cho pö monïngay akïrop ewunechi ewuno monïngay. Otini kikana kegh por pö monïngay kïlalangit poray pö monïng. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïnget Elisya akïwesteghö köyay akïmïla ngat kïkapapana monïngay. Kuryon monïngay kïnyïl mut nko odeny, akïngany konyichi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïkur Elisya Keasi akïmwochï kïkurï yoto monïngay. Nyini kilïtï kïlenchï, “Anyona werïngu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kupïtyï kokonay kelyo Elisya ompö konyït, atolapay kumït werïnyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Töngönchintin odeny walaka",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïmïla ngat Elisya Kilkal, ato ki wow kömöy nyoman korononi. Kimi nyinte asistanka nko werkoy, kïlenchï Elisya Keasi, “Tighö tör aighchï pïchï omisyö.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïwö chi akong ompö chane par kïpït onkïy. Kïnyorï ket nyo lata mïnyany, kïpït akwe cho teno cho kimuköy kïsït. Nyini kit kaw, kïmutmut akughogh amelö kinkït lö kine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
