        {
          "text": "Kungwïna chi Paal Syelisya nyo kipchï Elisya makatin tömönut odeny cho kikigha pïsya matay cho le poretayi könyinoni nko yiti pagha nkanun cho kitökekösöy. Kïmwochï Elisya mötworintenyi kïpagha pïchay makatinechay. ",
